                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A nice platformer from the mid-90s I was unaware of. You have a choice of two characters, a brother and a sister, who have different weapons and abilities. The brother has a sword and more health and the sister shoots projectiles, can jump higher but has less health. You can also change characters on the fly. The gameplay is quite simple yet fun.\r\n\r\nJust before the end, I had to use a cheat to progress to the final boss because I was unable to progress through the section. I saw the same problem in a YouTube walkthrough so maybe the problem wasn't just in my playing but there was an actual problem in the level.\r\n\r\nI recommend this game for people who are interested in older 2D platformers.",
